公；原，原公；辛，辛甲；尹，尹佚：皆周太史。〕重之以周、邵、畢、榮，〔周，周文公。邵，邵康公。畢，畢公。榮，","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":4,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:hanshu-eb969eba8b9bb8ea","bookId":"book:hanshu","requestedTitle":"漢書/卷020","title":"漢書/卷020","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%BC%A2%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7020","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2117895","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%BC%A2%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7020?action=history","revisionId":2117895,"revisionTimestamp":"2022-03-27T12:27:09Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:36:02.073Z","sha256":"2ff5dbae42461eb5f2f4ab338de77bc67c8be89059051ee9e05e2c70798018a3","textSha256":"50edb6dfa53db0e3049c444f1c4fc2fb7fd50d64ecf4858d4f15f117f362db09","expandedWikitextSha256":"2ff5dbae42461eb5f2f4ab338de77bc67c8be89059051ee9e05e2c70798018a3","characters":22611,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/hanshu.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:35.242Z","upstreamTextQuality":null,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed","textCompleteness":"not-independently-collated","extractionNotes":[],"expandedTransclusionTitles":[],"transclusionIssues":[],"transclusions":[],"textPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/documents/402356160ad9210fd753.json","wikitextPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/wikitext/402356160ad9210fd753.json","relatedDocumentIds":[]},{"id":"document:xintangshu-2a953a0b63acad33","bookId":"book:xintangshu","requestedTitle":"新唐書/卷015","title":"新唐書/卷015","sourceUrl":"https://zh